# Copy to .dev.vars for `pnpm dev` (wrangler dev). .dev.vars is gitignored.
# In production, set these with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME>

# Private mode (owner signs in, guests use invite links). SECRET_KEY without an owner sign-in is
# a configuration error; leave everything unset (or set OPEN_MODE=1) for open mode.
# SECRET_KEY=generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-32
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-10-chars-min

# Optional: Cloudflare Realtime TURN (dashboard → Realtime → TURN Server → Create)
# CF_TURN_KEY_ID=
# CF_TURN_API_TOKEN=
